  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7nr9m0q/Boosted-FPS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"586\" height=\"78\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>基于 Fabric 的模组包，包含性能优化模组和调整，让你的 Minecraft 运行得更好更快！完全支持 Sodium（请阅读下方配置）。该包现已支持 1.16.5、1.17.1、1.18.2、1.19.4、1.20.6、1.21 及 26.1 版本的 Fabric 版本。<br></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Forge 版本请前往：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-forge</a></strong></span></p><p><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">NeoForge 版本请前往：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-neoforge</a></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Quilt 版本请前往：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-quilt\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-quilt</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>RPG 版本请前往：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-rpg</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LdG4vgH/Features.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"403\" height=\"64\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/675/498/2023-06-10_23.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"634\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（以下功能将进一步改善你的原版体验）</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">最新更新——享受包含最新模组的更新！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FPS 性能提升——得益于 Sodium 移植版及其他性能增强模组。本包包含了大多数基于 Fabric 的性能优化模组。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组配置——在游戏菜单中显示“模组”按钮，列出已安装的模组（也可在此配置模组设置）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">额外生活品质模组——让你在 Minecraft 中的游戏体验更加愉快。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Hypixel 就绪——已预加载 Hypixel 服务器，安装即可畅玩！</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>原版（无模组）FPS：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mFgNnsD/vanilla-screenshot.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Boosted FPS 模组包：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rMZBCHR/boosted-screenshot.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/P6pJTy8/Config.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"270\" height=\"86\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">渲染距离已设置为较低值（例如 5）以最大化 FPS。可将其提高至 8 或更高以看到更远距离。你可以在“选项/视频设置/常规/渲染距离”中更改。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FPS 超过刷新率或出现画面撕裂？可在“选项/视频设置/常规”中开启垂直同步。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在视频设置的着色器包部分启用着色器（如果你的系统能够支持）。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FAv8Axl7GIo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9mN4mjBuPXA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fYFU4QtCzEw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ge32Bcch5UY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pmiSOeedr3k?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3g58tPSTmpQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就来获取服务器，和朋友们一起玩吧！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，使用代码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 可享 25% 折扣！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
